## 2. FES Layer Implementation

### 2.1 ENGINE Layer (Actor)

```text
T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py/src/executor_py/actor/__init__.py
  ├── Actor (ABC base class)
  │   ├── Lifecycle: start(), stop(), health(), receipt(), telemetry()
  │   ├── Capability registry: register_capability(), fan_registry.find()
  │   ├── Executor delegation: register_executor(), execute()
  │   └── Module delegation: register_module(), find_module()
  │
  ├── ActorConfig
  └── CompositeActor + CompositeActorConfig
```

### 2.2 EXECUTOR Layer (Executor)

```text
T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py/src/executor_py/executor/__init__.py
  ├── IpoFeature (ABC, Generic[T])
  │   ├── input() → IpoInput
  │   ├── process() → CaporDecision + RacRoute
  │   ├── output() → IpoOutput (with SepiProof)
  │   └── execute() → full IPO chain
  │
  ├── Executor (implements IpoFeature)
  │   ├── capor: CaporRouter (WHAT capacity)
  │   ├── racor: RacRouter (HOW/WHERE route)
  │   └── orchestrator: DefaultIpoOrchestrator
  │
  ├── ExecutorConfig
  └── SimpleExecutor (default IPO orchestrator)
```

### 2.3 MODULE Layer (ExecutorModule)

```text
T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py/src/executor_py/module/__init__.py
  ├── ExecutorModule (ABC)
  │   ├── register_method()
  │   ├── get_method()
  │   ├── list_methods()
  │   └── execute()
  │
  ├── FdiModule       (wired/autoload: USB/cable)
  ├── FpiModule       (wireless: Bluetooth/NFC)
  └── LibraryModule   (pure algorithm)
```

### 2.4 LIBRARY Layer (core.py)

```text
T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py/src/executor_py/core.py
  ├── ExecContext / ExecInput / ExecOutput
  ├── FanId / FanCapability / FanRegistry
  ├── ExecuteParticle (ABC)
  ├── SepiProof (FEH + ALR sealing)
  ├── ExecuteError
  ├── Enums: SioStatus, SioType, ExecutionMode, ParticleClass,
  │          SecurityLevel, FesLayer, RacTransportKind, RacRule
  └── Data types: SioEnvelope, SioResult, TransportConfig, ExecutorDNA,
                  ActorExecutorMapping, EnginePart
```

## 3. CRI Transport Layer

```text
T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py/src/executor_py/io/rac/cri/
  ├── fdi.py  → FDI (wired/autoload: USB/cable)
  │   ├── FdiExecutor       (FDI executor with autoload/discover/load)
  │   ├── FdiTransport      (transport layer: file/pipe/fd/shm)
  │   ├── FDIRegistry       (method registry)
  │   └── FdiModule         (FES MODULE layer)
  │
  └── fpi.py  → FPI (wireless: Bluetooth/NFC discovery + pairing)
      ├── FpiExecutor       (FPI executor with discover/pair/invoke)
      ├── FpiTransport      (transport layer: bluetooth/nfc/pair/host_call)
      ├── FPIRegistry       (method registry)
      └── FpiModule         (FES MODULE layer)

T:/hace/engine/hace/sdk/executor-py/src/executor_py/io/
  ├── transport/
  │   ├── stdio.py     → StdioServerTransport (STDIO JSON-RPC 2.0)
  │   ├── http.py      → HttpServerTransport
  │   └── ws.py       → WsServerTransport
  └── rac/__init__.py  → create_fdi_executor(), create_fpi_executor()
```

## 4. RAC Contracts (V4 Grammar)

```text
rac://{rule}.{ownerspace}.{specs}/{path}

Examples:
  rac://cri.hace.fdi/hace/text-editor/file/read_file
  rac://cri.hace.fpi/hace/text-editor/device/connect
  rac://cri.hace.ffi/hace/rion/resolve_route
  rac://api.hace.http/hace/rion/execute
```

## 5. RAC Method Contracts

| Method | Contract URI | Transport | IPO Mode |
|---|---|---|---|
| call | `rac://cri.hace.fdi/{path}` | FDI/FPI/FFI | LocalExecute |
| import | `rac://cri.hace.ffi/{path}` | FFI | LocalExecute |
| instance | `rac://cri.hace.fc/{path}` | FCI | SubExecute |
| ping | `rac://cri.hace.hc/{path}` | HostCall | PassThrough |
| stream | `rac://cri.hace.fdi/{path}` | FDI/STDIO | ChainExecute |
| transfer | `rac://cri.hace.fdi/{path}` | FDI/FFI | ChainExecute |
| teleport | `rac://cri.hace.fdi/{path}` | Wasm | ChainExecute |
| watch | `rac://cri.hace.fdi/{path}` | FDI/STDIO | ChainExecute |

